{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_18","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '1,360p' Pipeline/Reconciliation/README.md; sed -n '1,280p' Pipeline/Reconciliation/reconciliation_agent.py; sed -n '1,280p' Pipeline/Reconciliation/verification_crew.py; sed -n '1,260p' Pipeline/Reconciliation/output_layout.py; git log --date=short --format='%h %ad %s' -- Pipeline/Reconciliation | sed -n '1,220p'\"","aggregated_output":"fe1a4dc 2026-08-21 Record successful reconciliation verification output\n4736efa 2026-08-21 Fixes the fresh reconciliation boundary failure caused by the global pipeline worker legitimately inspecting the repository’s root .gitignore.\nb4b4624 2026-08-21 Fix prompt smoke test whitespace matching\n3e47dc2 2026-08-21 Test narrow gitignore reconciliation boundary\n4300e95 2026-08-21 Make cumulative installer tolerate materialized fresh-run fixes\nb2cc2f6 2026-08-21 Close fresh-run reconciliation verification gaps\n4149d94 2026-08-21 Add verifier immediate-retry regression test\n50ed73f 2026-08-21 Test final material convergence policy\n7da22f8 2026-08-21 Cover summary provenance tolerance regression\ne8d0aca 2026-08-21 Close fresh-run reconciliation verification gaps\n0534010 2026-08-21 Add fresh-run closure smoke test\n091cbc5 2026-08-21 Fix streaming repair identity-order application\n43b230d 2026-08-21 Add streaming identity-order regression test\n90fdb15 2026-08-21 Merged in final provenance verification\na94212f 2026-08-21 Refine streaming verification and close remaining graph gaps\necf5d15 2026-08-21 Add deterministic finding identity smoke test\nf5d8bd2 2026-08-21 Cover semantic key dedupe in streaming v2 smoke test\n19d01db 2026-08-21 Add streaming refinement v2 smoke test\n4f7911b 2026-08-21 Add field-level streaming refinement v2\n4aa2a81 2026-08-21 Add reconciliation evidence guard and recovery\n2b084d1 2026-08-21 Add streaming verification refinement and closure fixes\n2edee13 2026-08-20 Bound reconciliation refinem